<title>USA: FSA qualifies Grapevine, Texas, for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies Grapevine, Texas, for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said it has added a $28.915 million Grapevine, Texas, deal to the list of competitive offerings it qualified for bond insurance Thursday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
